      "id": "q19_solution",
      "condition": "(1) $\\angle\\text{C}=90^\\circ$, $\\overline{\\text{AC}}=5\\text{ cm}$, $\\overline{\\text{BC}}=12\\text{ cm}$이므로 피타고라스 정리에 의해 $$\\overline{\\text{AB}} = \\sqrt{5^2 + 12^2} = 13\\text{ (cm)}$$ 따라서 $$\\sin B = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{AC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AB}}} = \\frac{5}{13}, \\quad \\cos B = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{BC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AB}}} = \\frac{12}{13}, \\quad \\tan B = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{AC}}}{\\overline{\\text{BC}}} = \\frac{5}{12}$$ (2) $\\angle\\text{C}=90^\\circ$이므로 $\\sin 90^\\circ = 1$, $\\cos 90^\\circ = 0$이고, $\\tan 90^\\circ$는 정의되지 않는다.",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
